# Earning argument: precondition is turn-39 (a traced claim to witness)
# and turn-32's own committed magnitude-ground-control.json. Refuted if
# noise-control's widths exceeded a comparable threshold to the two
# anomalies' — checked, -0.10 is not remotely comparable to 96.04 or 62.49.

